This repository redistributes a database derived from OpenStreetMap. Under the
Open Database License (ODbL) v1.0, any public distribution of that derived
database — the JSON under data/ and dist/data/, the KML/KMZ exports, and the
geometry embedded in the offline build — must:

  * attribute "© OpenStreetMap contributors" (the map does, in every popup and
    in the Leaflet attribution control);
  * be offered under ODbL, not MIT. The MIT grant above covers the Python,
    JavaScript, CSS and HTML only.

  Boundaries, green areas, transit routes, grocery stores  © OpenStreetMap
  contributors, ODbL 1.0 — https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/

Other sources retain their own terms:

  Crime statistics   Justiits- ja Digiministeerium, "Kuritegevus Eestis 2025"
  Census             Statistikaamet (RL21302 / RL21434 / RL21439)
  Rent observations  Aggregated counts derived from public kv.ee and
                     City24.ee listings. No listing text, image or contact
                     detail is redistributed. See docs/data-sources.md before
                     running the rent verifier on a schedule.
